atwo budować intensywność glow – od subtelnego połysku po spektakularny efekt.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-s1ucyroxi7" data-id="ecom-s1ucyroxi7" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-4a533xi8bk4"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-ms2f1d8jlh" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">Poznaj pełny skład</h3></div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-d0gqtb4oha" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Ingredients: Aqua, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Silica, Propanediol, Sorbitan Isostearate, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polysorbate 60, Polysorbate 20, Mica, Parfum, Vanillin, CI 77891, CI 77491.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-tdeqoiqzx8" data-id="ecom-tdeqoiqzx8" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-vnkdfl4b5ur"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ec